```Title: Run Key Set to a Script Host or a File in Temp or Public (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1547.001 | Severity: medium | Sigma id: d7fc5b74-b156-4945-8594-06413d95008b```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 13 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: Installers using RunOnce to finish setup with a script after reboot```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity medium.```
index=sysmon source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=13
(TargetObject IN ("*\\CurrentVersion\\Run\\*", "*\\CurrentVersion\\RunOnce\\*", "*\\CurrentVersion\\RunOnceEx\\*", "*\\Policies\\Explorer\\Run\\*") Details IN ("*powershell*", "*pwsh*", "*mshta*", "*wscript*", "*cscript*", "*regsvr32*", "*cmd.exe /c*", "*cmd /c*", "*%COMSPEC%*", "*\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\*", "*\\Users\\Public\\*"))
| table _time host User Image EventType TargetObject Details
